<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Shield cricket standings after the match completed on Tuesday (tabulate under played, won outright, won on first innings, drawn, lost on first innings, lost outright, points):</p>
<p> Western Australia  7   4   2   0   0   1   28</p>
<p> New South Wales    8   3   1   0   1   3   22</p>
<p> Queensland	   6   3   1   0   1   1   20</p>
<p> Tasmania	     7   2   1   0   1   3   18</p>
<p> Victoria	     7   3   0   0   1   3   17.7</p>
<p> South Australia    7   1   0   0   1   5    6</p>
<p>Note: Western Australia took first innings points before match against Queensland was drawn, New South Wales took first innings points before losing to Victoria and Tasmania took first innings points before losing outright to Victoria and Western Australia. Victoria deducted 0.3 points for slow over rate against New South Wales.</p>
</text>
